WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:08.076
Mai Laushin Kaya da Sabulun Tsabtace Gida. Wannan shi ne babi na 4 na kwas ɗin.

2
00:00:08.476 --> 00:00:23.277
Za mu yi mai laushin kaya, fesa na goge wurare da ruwansa mai kauri, sabulun wanke ƙasa da maganin cire dattin ban ɗaki, mu kuma koyi dokokin haɗawa da ke kare mutane.

3
00:00:24.277 --> 00:00:34.877
Wannan kwaɓin da ke kan ma'auni shi ne esterquat, sinadarin da ke sa kaya laushi, galibi kusan 90% mai aiki.

4
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:42.870
Cationic ne, don haka yana manne wa auduga, wadda ke ɗauke da ɗan cajin korau a cikin ruwa.

5
00:00:43.211 --> 00:00:54.497
Mai laushin kaya na yau da kullum yana da kusan 4 zuwa 6% kawai mai aiki. Ga tsarin farko na kilogiram 20.

6
00:00:55.497 --> 00:01:10.553
Esterquat yana iya ɓata ido da fata, kuma da ɗumi za ki riƙe shi. Ki saka safar hannu da gilashin kariya, ki yi motsi a hankali don kada ki ƙone.

7
00:01:11.553 --> 00:01:21.294
Ki dumama ruwan zuwa zafin da ke kan takardar mai sayar miki, ki ɗan sa masa tsami idan takardar ta ce haka.

8
00:01:21.658 --> 00:01:34.284
Ki kalla: esterquat da ya yi laushi yana shiga ruwan ɗumi a hankali yayin da muke juyawa ba tsayawa, kuma yana komawa fari kamar madara.

9
00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:44.311
Ki ci gaba da juyawa yayin da yake hucewa yana kauri. Ƙasa da kusan digiri 40, ki ƙara turare, preservative da launi.

10
00:01:45.311 --> 00:01:59.589
Blessing a Benin City ta lissafa wannan a teburinta. Kusan kurkura 33 a kowace kwalba, wajen naira 45 a kowane wanki bisa farashinta na kusan.

11
00:02:00.031 --> 00:02:12.051
Ki gaya wa kowane mai saye: a wanke a kurkura da sabulu tukuna. Mai laushin kaya a kurkurar ƙarshe kawai yake shiga, ba a taɓa haɗa shi da sabulun wanki ba.

12
00:02:13.051 --> 00:02:26.650
Ki ga yadda fesan ke watsuwa a kan teburi kuma yana gogewa ba tare da barin layi ba. Kumfa kaɗan, saura kaɗan, yana bushewa da sauri.

13
00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:39.887
Surfactant na nonionic yana wankewa da kumfa kaɗan, kuma isopropyl alcohol yana ɗaga maiko yana sa bushewa ta yi sauri.

14
00:02:40.356 --> 00:02:45.575
Ki haɗa turaren da surfactant har ya yi haske kafin ya shiga ruwan.

15
00:02:46.575 --> 00:02:57.581
Ki haɗa wannan fesan kusa da taga a buɗe kamar wannan, nesa da wuta, gas na girki da janareta. Ki riƙe gangar a rufe.

16
00:02:58.053 --> 00:03:08.032
Kuma kada ki taɓa ƙara bilicin, quat ko asid don ƙara masa ƙarfi. Hakan yana haifar da haɗi masu haɗari.

17
00:03:09.032 --> 00:03:19.259
Ofisoshi suna son ruwa mai kauri da ake tsarmawa. Dubi waɗannan kofuna daga mai ƙarfi zuwa mai rauni.

18
00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:38.966
1:19 yana nufin kashi 1 na ruwa mai kauri da kashi 19 na ruwa. Aisha a Abuja tana ba ofishinta kofin awo na mililita 25 da katin tsarmawa da aka buga.

19
00:03:39.966 --> 00:03:52.922
Kullum ki gwada tsarmawarki kafin ki kai kaya, a kan teburi mai maiko da gilashi. Sannan ki gwada ɗan wurin da ba a gani, ki bar shi ya bushe, ki duba ko ya dusashe.

20
00:03:53.922 --> 00:04:05.978
Yanzu ana zuba ruwa mai kauri na wanke ƙasa a bokitin ruwa. Ya kamata ya gauraye da sauri ba tare da ɗigon mai yana yawo ba, da kumfa kaɗan.

21
00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:22.515
Funmi a Akure ta gano cewa mililita 40 a kowane bokiti yana wanke ƙasa da kyau ba tare da ya bar ta da ɗanko ba, ta kuma ba wata makaranta adadin odar wata-wata a fili.

22
00:04:23.515 --> 00:04:39.450
Dattin da ya kama kwanon ban ɗaki yana buƙatar asid. Muna amfani da citric acid, ba hydrochloric acid ba, wanda ke fitar da hayaƙi mai cin jiki kuma yana jawo mummunar ƙuna.

23
00:04:39.891 --> 00:04:51.695
Ki fara baza xanthan gum a hankali cikin ruwan da ake juyawa, sannan ki narkar da citric acid. Kaurin yana taimaka wa jel ɗin ya manne a ƙarƙashin bakin kwanon.

24
00:04:52.695 --> 00:05:04.113
Ki gwada maganin da kika gama da takardar gwaji. Ya kamata ya nuna tsami mai ƙarfi. Ki zuba shi a kwalba mai murfin da yara ba sa iya buɗewa.

25
00:05:05.113 --> 00:05:18.147
Dubi waɗannan kwalabe biyu, an raba su. Bilicin da maganin ban ɗaki na asid ko ruwan tsami suna fitar da iskar chlorine, wadda ke lalata huhu.

26
00:05:18.627 --> 00:05:30.260
Bilicin da sabulun ammonia suna fitar da iskar chloramine. Ki yi amfani da kaya ɗaya, ki kurkura ko ki zubar da ruwa, sannan na gaba.

27
00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:44.833
Idan wani ya shaƙi hayaƙin sabulun da aka haɗa, ki fitar da shi zuwa iska mai kyau nan take ki nemi taimakon likita. Ki buɗe tagogi, kada ki koma cikin rufaffen ban ɗakin.

28
00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:56.732
Ki buga taimakon gaggawa a jikin rubutun maganin: idan ya shiga ido, a wanke da ruwa mai yawa a nemi shawarar likita.

29
00:05:57.107 --> 00:06:03.696
Idan an haɗiye, a kurkure baki, kada a sa amai, a nemi taimakon likita nan take.

30
00:06:04.696 --> 00:06:20.262
Yanzu ki bi darussan da ke ƙasa. Ki yi haɗin gwajin mai laushin kaya, ki gwada fesanki da ruwansa mai kauri, ki rubuta katin zubi da rubutun gargaɗi. Sannan ki koya wa wani a gida dokokin kada-a-haɗa.

